## Quick Cheat Sheet

```javascript
// Parent
element.parentElement;

// Children
element.children;

// First child
element.firstElementChild;

// Last child
element.lastElementChild;

// Next sibling
element.nextElementSibling;

// Previous sibling
element.previousElementSibling;

// Find nearest matching parent
element.closest(".card");
```

### In One Sentence

> **DOM traversal is the process of navigating between elements in the DOM tree using relationships such as parent, child, sibling, and ancestor.**
